{
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Act 11: Same Fire, Different Arsonists",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s12b01",
     "shot": "smoke",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Everyone looking at the same smoke is describing a different fire.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       "w:different",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b02",
     "shot": "smoke",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "So let me walk through what each camp is actually saying,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b03",
     "shot": "smoke",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "in the version its own supporters would recognise.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b04",
     "shot": "gov_camp",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The government says a peaceful protest was hijacked by a violent minority.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b05",
     "shot": "gov_camp",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The President said there was no room for violence and that rioters would be prosecuted.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b06",
     "shot": "gov_camp",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The Prime Minister said nobody would impose a political agenda through violence,",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b07",
     "shot": "gov_camp",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and accused the far-left France Unbowed party of using the unrest as a warm-up",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b08",
     "shot": "gov_camp",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "for the presidential election.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b09",
     "shot": "lfi_camp",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "That party's leader, Jean-Luc Melenchon, rejected the charge and told the Prime Minister to",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b10",
     "shot": "lfi_camp",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "prove it or apologise.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b11",
     "shot": "lfi_camp",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "He has backed the students and criticised the use of tear gas and batons against young people.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b12",
     "shot": "rn_camp",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "On the other side, the far-right National Rally says the government has failed at",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b13",
     "shot": "rn_camp",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "the most basic job of a state, keeping order.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b14",
     "shot": "rn_camp",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Its president, Jordan Bardella, called the President's televised address lamentable.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b15",
     "shot": "rn_camp",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Marine Le Pen called the government exhausted and incapable,",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b16",
     "shot": "rn_camp",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and said rioters had spoiled a demonstration held in defence of purchasing power.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b17",
     "shot": "abroad",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Abroad, Donald Trump blamed 'mass migration' and Islam.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b18",
     "shot": "abroad",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "President Macron's reply was that foreign leaders were exploiting French riots for their own",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b19",
     "shot": "abroad",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "election purposes, with American midterms days away.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b20",
     "shot": "analysts",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And the economists and analysts, mostly, point at three things:",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       "w:three",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b21",
     "shot": "analysts",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "debt, prices and under-funded schools.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:debt,",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:prices",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:schools.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b22",
     "shot": "analysts",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Some add that the movement has drifted from school grievances toward plain lawlessness.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b23",
     "shot": "both_sides",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Each side has a point its supporters would want you to hear.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b24",
     "shot": "both_sides",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Those condemning the violence note that half a million people marched,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b25",
     "shot": "both_sides",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "that the people who pay for arson and looting are shopkeepers,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b26",
     "shot": "both_sides",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "local workers and public services, and that no grievance justifies it.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b27",
     "shot": "both_sides",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Those defending the protesters note that the school staffing figures are documented,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b28",
     "shot": "both_sides",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "that the grievances were real before anyone threw anything,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b29",
     "shot": "both_sides",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and that policing deserves scrutiny.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b30",
     "shot": "both_sides",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Both of those can be true at once.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:true",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b31",
     "shot": "not_telling",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "I'm not going to tell you which camp is right.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b32",
     "shot": "not_telling",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "What I can do is show you what history says about moments like this.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b33",
     "shot": "not_telling",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But first, a look at what the people in the middle of it are actually facing.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b34",
     "shot": "sketch_budget",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "We need to find 43 billion euros.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "kaching",
       "w:43",
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b35",
     "shot": "sketch_budget",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "Raise taxes?",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b36",
     "shot": "sketch_budget",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "The wealthy will leave.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b37",
     "shot": "sketch_budget",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "Cut spending?",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b38",
     "shot": "sketch_budget",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "On what?",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b39",
     "shot": "sketch_budget",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "Schools.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b40",
     "shot": "sketch_budget",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "The schools are on strike.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slam",
       8,
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b41",
     "shot": "sketch_budget",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "Pensions?",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b42",
     "shot": "sketch_budget",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "Last time we touched pensions, the country caught fire.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boom",
       "w:fire.",
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b43",
     "shot": "sketch_budget",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "Borrow more?",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b44",
     "shot": "sketch_budget",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "The markets are charging us the highest rate in twenty years.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b45",
     "shot": "sketch_budget",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "So what's the plan?",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b46",
     "shot": "sketch_budget",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "We'll form a committee.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boing",
       "w:committee.",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s12b47",
     "shot": "sketch_budget",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "Oh good. A committee.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "deflate",
       6,
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "playful"
    }
   ],
   "mood": "modern"
  }
 ]
